    "detailed_description": "Action Sports, Multiplayer Combat<br />\r\nIntense multiplayer battles where you can go solo or team up, but there's only one ultimate goal - to get out alive!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose Your Profession Freely<br />\r\nProfessions with distinct styles to suit your different combat preferences. A variety of weapons for free combination, fighting to the last moment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Map Styles, Rich Rewards<br />\r\nCreepy towns, mysterious tombs... Various maps, different styles, all equally dangerous!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the Fun of Treasure Hunting<br />\r\nKill monsters to uncover treasures, or plunder from other players. As long as you make it out alive, the spoils are yours!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScience, Mystery, Treasure, Monsters, Companions, Plunder...<br />\r\nIn the dangerous underworld, who will be the ultimate ruler?<br />\r\nThe vast treasure lying dormant, whose hands will it fall into?",
